  "label": "Antisemitic Trope: Dehumanization of Jewish People or Israel",
  "description": "This trope involves portraying Jewish people or the State of Israel as inherently corrupt, dangerous, or a threat to global stability. It is often used to justify hatred, discrimination, or violence against them. The dehumanizing language in the meme ('worst cancer') is a direct application of this trope, aiming to strip the target of moral or human dignity.",
